WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.878 --> 00:00:09.311
&gt;&gt; Tucker: LAST NIGHT AS AMERICA

00:00:09.312 --> 00:00:11.680
REALLY DID FOR A MOMENT SEEM ON

00:00:11.681 --> 00:00:15.451
THE BRINK OF WAR WITH IRAN, SOME

00:00:15.452 --> 00:00:17.486
ON TWITTER VOICED THEIR

00:00:17.487 --> 00:00:20.256
DISPLEASURE BY TWEETING THE HASH

00:00:20.257 --> 00:00:23.325
TAG "I VOTED FOR HILLARY."

00:00:23.326 --> 00:00:24.226
HILLARY CLINTON HERSELF HAD TO

00:00:24.227 --> 00:00:26.395
JOIN IN.

00:00:26.396 --> 00:00:27.796
THE MESSAGE OF COURSE IS THAT

00:00:27.797 --> 00:00:29.665
PRESIDENT HILLARY WOULD NOT BE

00:00:29.666 --> 00:00:31.800
STARTING A WAR WITH IRAN.

00:00:31.801 --> 00:00:32.534
IS THAT TRUE?

00:00:32.535 --> 00:00:34.603
THE SINGLE MOST LIKELY PERSON IN

00:00:34.604 --> 00:00:37.439
THE HISTORY OF AMERICA TO START

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:39.575
A WAR WITH IRAN.

00:00:39.576 --> 00:00:41.343
HOW'D THAT WORK?

00:00:41.344 --> 00:00:44.280
THEY'RE NOW SELLING SLAVES IN

00:00:44.281 --> 00:00:45.080
DOWNTOWN TRIPOLI.

00:00:45.081 --> 00:00:45.381
WATCH.

00:00:45.382 --> 00:00:47.650
&gt;&gt; THAT IS THE LAND OF

00:00:47.651 --> 00:00:48.517
UNCONFIRMED VIDEOS.

00:00:48.518 --> 00:00:52.588
WE CAME, WE SAW, WE DIED.

00:00:52.589 --> 00:00:54.623
[ LAUGHTER ]

00:00:54.624 --> 00:00:55.324
&gt;&gt; DIDN'T HAVE ANYTHING TO DO

00:00:55.325 --> 00:00:55.925
WITH YOU, DID IT?

00:00:55.926 --> 00:00:59.228
&gt;&gt; I'M SURE IT DID.

00:00:59.229 --> 00:00:59.995
&gt;&gt; Tucker:

00:00:59.996 --> 00:01:00.396
[ LAUGHTER ]

00:01:00.397 --> 00:01:01.463
WE KILLED THEM.

00:01:01.464 --> 00:01:03.599
IT WAS HILARIOUS.

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:06.635
THAT COUNTRY FALLS APART AND

00:01:06.636 --> 00:01:07.670
SLAVE MARKETS OPEN.

00:01:07.671 --> 00:01:10.039
IF ANYTHING, HILLARY CLINTON'S

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:12.141
INTENTIONS TOWARD IRAN WERE EVEN

00:01:12.142 --> 00:01:13.609
MORE BLOOD THIRSTY.

00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:15.678
THE FIRST TIME SHE WAS RUNNING

00:01:15.679 --> 00:01:18.714
FOR PRESIDENT SHE WARNED THAT

00:01:18.715 --> 00:01:19.782
IRAN BETTER BE READY.

00:01:19.783 --> 00:01:22.618
&gt;&gt; IF IRAN WERE TO LAUNCH A

00:01:22.619 --> 00:01:24.987
NUCLEAR ATTACK ON ISRAEL, WHAT

00:01:24.988 --> 00:01:25.921
WOULD THE RESPONSE BE.

00:01:25.922 --> 00:01:28.524
IF I'M THE PRESIDENT, WE WILL

00:01:28.525 --> 00:01:29.858
ATTACK IRAN.

00:01:29.859 --> 00:01:31.160
WHATEVER STAGE OF DEVELOPMENT

00:01:31.161 --> 00:01:33.295
THEY MIGHT BE IN THEIR NUCLEAR

00:01:33.296 --> 00:01:34.763
WEAPONS PROGRAM IN THE NEXT TEN

00:01:34.764 --> 00:01:36.999
YEARS DURING WHICH THEY MIGHT

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:38.801
CONSIDER FOOLISHLY LAUNCHING AN

00:01:38.802 --> 00:01:41.503
ATTACK ON ISRAEL, WE WOULD BE

00:01:41.504 --> 00:01:44.707
ABLE TO TOTALLY OBLITERATE THEM.

00:01:44.708 --> 00:01:46.475
&gt;&gt; Tucker: JUST IN CASE YOU

00:01:46.476 --> 00:01:48.143
DIDN'T REMEMBER THAT HILLARY

00:01:48.144 --> 00:01:52.948
CLINTON WAS THE ERNEOCON.

00:01:52.949 --> 00:01:55.718
ONE PERSON YOU WILL REMEMBER IS

00:01:55.719 --> 00:01:56.652
TULSI GABBARD.

00:01:56.653 --> 00:02:00.422
THANKS SO MUCH FOR COMING.

00:02:00.423 --> 00:02:02.424
I THINK SHE'S CAPABLE IN CERTAIN

00:02:02.425 --> 00:02:02.725
WAYS.

00:02:02.726 --> 00:02:05.427
I DON'T THINK EVERYTHING IS

00:02:05.428 --> 00:02:06.595
ABOUT HER IS BAD.

00:02:06.596 --> 00:02:08.063
&gt;&gt; YOU'RE NOT IMAGINING IT.

00:02:08.064 --> 00:02:09.798
I THINK EVERYBODY KNOWS AND

00:02:09.799 --> 00:02:11.934
UNDERSTANDS THAT SHE IS A

00:02:11.935 --> 00:02:12.334
WARMONGER.

00:02:12.335 --> 00:02:14.470
IT IS HER RECORD.

00:02:14.471 --> 00:02:15.771
&gt;&gt; Tucker: YOU'RE TOTALLY RIGHT.

00:02:15.772 --> 00:02:16.805
I LOVE THAT PHRASE.

00:02:16.806 --> 00:02:20.376
&gt;&gt; YOU SHOWED THE CLIP ABOUT

00:02:20.377 --> 00:02:20.709
LIBYA.

00:02:20.710 --> 00:02:21.210
&gt;&gt; Tucker: YEP.

00:02:21.211 --> 00:02:22.778
&gt;&gt; LOOKED TO HER INFLUENCE ON

00:02:22.779 --> 00:02:24.947
GOING TO LAUNCH REGIME CHANGE

00:02:24.948 --> 00:02:25.748
OVER IN SYRIA.

00:02:25.749 --> 00:02:28.283
LIBYA, YOU LOOKED THROUGHOUT

00:02:28.284 --> 00:02:28.984
OBVIOUSLY HER SUPPORT FOR THE

00:02:28.985 --> 00:02:30.019
WAR IN IRAQ.

00:02:30.020 --> 00:02:30.886
THROUGHOUT HER HISTORY.

00:02:30.887 --> 00:02:32.421
HER TRACK RECORD IS WELL-KNOWN.

00:02:32.422 --> 00:02:35.157
I THINK THIS IS WHY A LOT OF

00:02:35.158 --> 00:02:37.393
PEOPLE BACK IN 2016 IN THE

00:02:37.394 --> 00:02:38.594
GENERAL ELECTION DECIDED THAT

00:02:38.595 --> 00:02:40.029
THEY WOULD VOTE FOR TRUMP

00:02:40.030 --> 00:02:41.497
BECAUSE OF WHAT HE WAS SAYING ON

00:02:41.498 --> 00:02:42.965
THE CAMPAIGN TRAIL ABOUT ENDING

00:02:42.966 --> 00:02:43.832
STUPID WARS AND BRINGING OUR

00:02:43.833 --> 00:02:46.368
TROOPS HOME.

00:02:46.369 --> 00:02:48.837
THE PROBLEM NOW, THOUGH, IS --

00:02:48.838 --> 00:02:50.172
AND I'M OUT ON THE CAMPAIGN

00:02:50.173 --> 00:02:51.640
TRAIL AND HEARING FROM A LOT OF

00:02:51.641 --> 00:02:53.409
PEOPLE WHO HAD VOTED FOR TRUMP

00:02:53.410 --> 00:02:55.110
LARGELY BECAUSE OF THIS ISSUE

00:02:55.111 --> 00:02:57.379
AND THEIR CONCERN ABOUT HOW

00:02:57.380 --> 00:02:58.147
RATHER THAN ENDING STUPID WARS

00:02:58.148 --> 00:03:01.150
AND BRINGING OUR TROOPS HOME,

00:03:01.151 --> 00:03:02.651
WHAT THEY'RE SEEING IS MORE OF

00:03:02.652 --> 00:03:04.420
OUR TROOPS BEING DEPLOYED TO THE

00:03:04.421 --> 00:03:04.887
MIDDLE EAST.

00:03:04.888 --> 00:03:07.723
NOW US, OUR COUNTRY, AT WAR WITH

00:03:07.724 --> 00:03:08.023
IRAN.

00:03:08.024 --> 00:03:10.225
THEY'RE COMING AND SAYING, HEY,

00:03:10.226 --> 00:03:12.294
TULSI, WE'RE CONFIDENT THAT YOU

00:03:12.295 --> 00:03:13.262
AS PRESIDENT, COMMANDER IN

00:03:13.263 --> 00:03:15.731
CHIEF, WILL ACTUALLY END THESE

00:03:15.732 --> 00:03:16.265
LONG-STANDING --

00:03:16.266 --> 00:03:17.833
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WHAT SHOULD WE -- I

00:03:17.834 --> 00:03:19.768
THINK YOU MAKE A FAIR POINT.

00:03:19.769 --> 00:03:22.171
SO WHAT SHOULD WE DO GOING

00:03:22.172 --> 00:03:22.504
FORWARD?

00:03:22.505 --> 00:03:25.374
WE OPENED THE SHOW WITH A CALL

00:03:25.375 --> 00:03:27.342
FOR COMPLETE WITHDRAWAL FROM

00:03:27.343 --> 00:03:27.643
IRAN.

00:03:27.644 --> 00:03:29.678
YOU SERVED THERE IN THE U.S.

00:03:29.679 --> 00:03:30.412
ARMY.

00:03:30.413 --> 00:03:31.780
&gt;&gt; I'M THE ONLY CANDIDATE

00:03:31.781 --> 00:03:32.948
RUNNING FOR PRESIDENT WHO SERVED

00:03:32.949 --> 00:03:35.984
IN UNIFORM IN IRAQ.

00:03:35.985 --> 00:03:37.619
UNDERSTAND VERY CLEARLY THE

00:03:37.620 --> 00:03:38.120
SITUATION THERE.

00:03:38.121 --> 00:03:40.089
FOR DAYS NOW I'VE BEEN CALLING

00:03:40.090 --> 00:03:41.690
FOR OUR TROOPS FROM IRAQ AND

00:03:41.691 --> 00:03:42.558
SYRIA TO COME HOME.

00:03:42.559 --> 00:03:43.492
AND HERE'S WHY.

00:03:43.493 --> 00:03:47.229
WHEN WE DEPLOY OUR TROOPS

00:03:47.230 --> 00:03:48.897
DOWNRAGE, WHEN THEY'RE IN HARM'S

00:03:48.898 --> 00:03:50.332
WAY, THERE HAS TO BE A VERY

00:03:50.333 --> 00:03:52.067
CLEAR MISSION THAT'S ACHIEVABLE.

00:03:52.068 --> 00:03:53.368
WHERE THEY KNOW EXACTLY WHAT

00:03:53.369 --> 00:03:55.637
THEY'RE DOING THERE AND WHY, AND

00:03:55.638 --> 00:03:56.805
THAT THAT MISSION ACTUALLY

00:03:56.806 --> 00:03:58.841
SERVES OUR COUNTRY'S NATIONAL

00:03:58.842 --> 00:03:59.608
SECURITY INTERESTS.

00:03:59.609 --> 00:04:01.143
BUT THAT'S NOT WHAT'S HAPPENING

00:04:01.144 --> 00:04:01.677
RIGHT NOW.

00:04:01.678 --> 00:04:04.513
IN IRAQ ESPECIALLY.

00:04:04.514 --> 00:04:05.247
WE SEE HOW OUR TROOPS ARE THERE.

00:04:05.248 --> 00:04:07.316
THEY WERE SUPPOSED TO BE THERE

00:04:07.317 --> 00:04:10.285
TO PREVENT A RESURGENT OF ISIS

00:04:10.286 --> 00:04:11.186
AND AL QAEDA.

00:04:11.187 --> 00:04:12.387
THAT'S NOT WHAT'S HAPPENING NOW.

00:04:12.388 --> 00:04:14.690
THE U.S. COMMANDER IN IRAQ

00:04:14.691 --> 00:04:15.624
ANNOUNCING OUR U.S. TROOPS WILL

00:04:15.625 --> 00:04:18.427
NO LONGER BE PUTTING ANY EFFORTS

00:04:18.428 --> 00:04:20.129
TOWARDS PREVENTING AL QAEDA AND

00:04:20.130 --> 00:04:23.465
ISIS FROM MOUNTING A RESURGENCE

00:04:23.466 --> 00:04:24.867
BECAUSE THEY WILL HAVE TO

00:04:24.868 --> 00:04:26.668
DEDICATE ALL OF THEIR RESOURCES

00:04:26.669 --> 00:04:29.705
AND EFFORTS TO MOUNTING A

00:04:29.706 --> 00:04:32.107
DEFENSIVE POSTER AGAINST IRANIAN

00:04:32.108 --> 00:04:32.741
FORCES --

00:04:32.742 --> 00:04:35.377
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I'M NOT ENDORSING

00:04:35.378 --> 00:04:36.345
IRAN, OBVIOUSLY.

00:04:36.346 --> 00:04:36.879
&gt;&gt; OF COURSE NOT.

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:38.347
&gt;&gt; Tucker: JUST A POINT OF FACT,

00:04:38.348 --> 00:04:40.849
EVEN IN 2020, WASN'T IRAN ONE OF

00:04:40.850 --> 00:04:44.052
THE FORCES THAT OVERCAME ISIS?

00:04:44.053 --> 00:04:45.053
AM I IMAGINING?

00:04:45.054 --> 00:04:45.988
&gt;&gt; YES.

00:04:45.989 --> 00:04:47.556
AND IN IRAQ, THERE WAS THIS --

00:04:47.557 --> 00:04:50.526
THIS KIND OF LONG-STANDING

00:04:50.527 --> 00:04:52.327
UNEASY ALLIANCE BETWEEN U.S.

00:04:52.328 --> 00:04:52.661
FORCES.

00:04:52.662 --> 00:04:53.162
&gt;&gt; Tucker: YES.

00:04:53.163 --> 00:04:55.030
&gt;&gt; IRAQI GOVERNMENT FORCES.

00:04:55.031 --> 00:04:59.001
IRANIAN AND IRANIAN-BACKED SHIA

00:04:59.002 --> 00:05:01.870
MILITIAS AND THE KURDS THERE ALL

00:05:01.871 --> 00:05:03.505
COMING TOGETHER TO DEFEAT AND

00:05:03.506 --> 00:05:05.941
PREVENT A RESURGENCE OF ISIS AND

00:05:05.942 --> 00:05:06.308
AL QAEDA.

00:05:06.309 --> 00:05:08.544
AND THIS IS WHERE,

00:05:08.545 --> 00:05:09.545
UNFORTUNATELY, PRESIDENT TRUMP'S

00:05:09.546 --> 00:05:11.413
ACTIONS ARE ACTUALLY UNDERMINING

00:05:11.414 --> 00:05:12.514
OUR NATIONAL SECURITY IN TWO

00:05:12.515 --> 00:05:13.582
IMPORTANT WAYS.

00:05:13.583 --> 00:05:15.050
BECAUSE OUR TROOPS ARE NO LONGER

00:05:15.051 --> 00:05:17.119
ABLE TO FOCUS ON THAT MISSION

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:19.888
OF -- OF PREVENTING ISIS FROM

00:05:19.889 --> 00:05:21.089
GETTING A RESURGENCE, IT'S

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:24.126
CREATING AN OPEN FOR ISIS AND AL

00:05:24.127 --> 00:05:25.827
QAEDA TO RECONSTITUTE THEMSELVES

00:05:25.828 --> 00:05:28.397
AND TO POSE A THREAT TO OUR

00:05:28.398 --> 00:05:30.566
FORCES, TO OUR COUNTRY AND OUR

00:05:30.567 --> 00:05:32.968
PEOPLE IN THE REGION.

00:05:32.969 --> 00:05:35.504
SECONDLY, IRAN HAS NOW SAID

00:05:35.505 --> 00:05:38.640
THEY'RE NO LONGER COMPLYING WITH

00:05:38.641 --> 00:05:41.843
RESTRICTIONS IN THE IRANIAN

00:05:41.844 --> 00:05:42.811
AGREEMENT, SPEEDING TOWARDS

00:05:42.812 --> 00:05:45.113
DEVELOPING THEIR OWN NUCLEAR

00:05:45.114 --> 00:05:46.682
WEAPONS CAPABILITY WHICH PUTS US

00:05:46.683 --> 00:05:48.717
AT GREATER RISK AND PUTS OUR

00:05:48.718 --> 00:05:50.552
PARTNERS AND ALLIES IN THE

00:05:50.553 --> 00:05:50.953
WORLD --

00:05:50.954 --> 00:05:51.954
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I GET IT.

00:05:51.955 --> 00:05:52.754
GETTING OUT OF --

00:05:52.755 --> 00:05:54.623
&gt;&gt; THIS IS WHY IT'S IMPORTANT.

00:05:54.624 --> 00:05:56.091
GETTING OUR TROOPS OUT OF IRAQ

00:05:56.092 --> 00:05:56.825
AND SYRIA IS ESSENTIAL.

00:05:56.826 --> 00:05:58.760
THE LONGER THAT THEY ARE THERE,

00:05:58.761 --> 00:06:00.362
THE MORE LIKELY IT IS THAT THEY

00:06:00.363 --> 00:06:02.097
ARE AT RISK AND THAT WE WILL END

00:06:02.098 --> 00:06:06.468
UP IN THIS ENDLESS TIT FOR TAT

00:06:06.469 --> 00:06:09.438
BACK AND FORTH QUAGMIRE OF A WAR

00:06:09.439 --> 00:06:12.175
WITH PEOPLE WONDERING WHAT IS IT

